meta {
  name: proposal-review
}

docs {
  # Proposal Review API

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Path | Name | Description |
  |--------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | /api/proposal-review/stats/:type | stats-type | Statistik review per tipe |
  | GET | /api/proposal-review/:type | get-by-type | List usulan per tipe |
  | GET | /api/proposal-review/:type/:id | get-by-id | Detail usulan untuk review |
  | POST | /api/proposal-review/:type/:id/approve | type-id-approve | Approve usulan |
  | POST | /api/proposal-review/:type/:id/reject | type-id-reject | Reject usulan |
  | GET | /api/proposal-review/user/revisi | user-revisi | List usulan revisi user |
  | GET | /api/proposal-review/user/approved | user-approved | List usulan approved user |
  | POST | /api/proposal-review/user/:id/resubmit | user-id-resubmit | Resubmit usulan revisi |
}
